      "rationale": "Closed-beta fail-closed finding was implemented independently in the shared worktree between plan authoring and the Improve-Plan reconcile (src/lib/auth/closed-beta-access.ts:60-68 + resolveClosedBetaRuntimeEnv helper + tests/vitest/closed-beta-access.test.ts). The in-tree design supersedes the planned unit: it separates Cloudflare Worker runtime (fail closed via ARCHESTIMATOR_CF_RUNTIME marker) from local Node (stay open for dogfooding), adds an explicit ARCHESTIMATOR_ALLOW_OPEN_BETA=1 kill-switch, and is test-covered. Executing the original UNIT-002 would clobber a superior in-flight implementation. SEC-002 → REJECTED, UNIT-002 → SUPERSEDED, RISK-001 → CLOSED, EVID-002 → STALE. Do not re-implement; if the in-tree implementation regresses, open a new plan against the current baseline."
